<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 834.37 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS FRI.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 834.37 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS FRI.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a hefty 834.37 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling a net 29.29 million rands on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
